BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Penang SMT Line Changeover Runbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: mfg-penang-smt-changeover-runbook. Owner: Penang Manufacturing Engineering) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (\(Factory Manager: Nurul Aziz\). Last reviewed: 2025-08-04. Form reference: MFG-F-112 \(SMT) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675 Td (Changeover Record\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 653 Td (This runbook is controlled. Printed copies at the line are for reference only; the controlled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 640 Td (version is the one published in the Meridian Instruments engineering knowledge base. If a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 627 Td (printed copy and the published version disagree, the published version wins and the line lead) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 614 Td (must replace the printed copy before the next shift.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 589 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (This runbook describes how a surface-mount technology \(SMT\) line at the Meridian Instruments) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (Penang factory in Bayan Lepas is changed over from one board family to another. It exists so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (that every changeover is done the same way on every shift, so that the line comes back to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (production quickly, and so that no board is released to volume production until the setup has) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 515 Td (been proven by a first article inspection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (The runbook follows single-minute exchange of die \(SMED\) principles. Work that can be done) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (while the line is still running the previous job is treated as external work and must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (completed before the line is stopped. Only work that genuinely requires the line to be stopped) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (is treated as internal work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 429 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (This runbook applies to the four SMT lines in the Penang factory, SMT-1 to SMT-4, and to every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 394 Td (changeover between the board families listed in section 4. It applies to all shifts, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (weekend overtime shifts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 359 Td (It does not cover:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (- New product introduction \(NPI\) builds, which follow the NPI build procedure and require a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324 Td (   manufacturing engineer to be present for the whole build.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 311 Td (- Changes of revision within the same board family where only the placement program changes;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 298 Td (   those are handled as a program-only change and recorded on MFG-F-112 with the changeover) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 285 Td (   type set to "program only".) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 272 Td (- Through-hole, selective solder, conformal coating and final assembly operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 259 Td (- Rework of boards after AOI; rework follows the rework station instruction.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 243 Td (3. Lines and equipment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 221 Td (Each of the four lines has the same equipment sequence. The lines are physically identical in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 208 Td (layout, but the placement machine feeder bank capacity differs between SMT-1/SMT-2 and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 195 Td (SMT-3/SMT-4, which affects which board families are normally scheduled on which line.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 174 Td (Line | Stencil printer | SPI | Placement machines | Reflow oven | AOI | Usual board families) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 162 Td (SMT-1 | 1 | 1 | 2 | 10-zone | 1 | HX-MB, LF60-SB) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 150 Td (SMT-2 | 1 | 1 | 2 | 10-zone | 1 | HX-MB, TS4E-EN) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 138 Td (SMT-3 | 1 | 1 | 2 | 10-zone | 1 | TS4-GW, TS4E-EN) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 126 Td (SMT-4 | 1 | 1 | 2 | 10-zone | 1 | TS4-GW, LF60-SB) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (Every line runs in this order: stencil printer, solder paste inspection \(SPI\), placement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 91 Td (machine 1, placement machine 2, 10-zone reflow oven, automated optical inspection \(AOI\). All) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 78 Td (four ovens are nitrogen-capable, but nitrogen is only required for the TS4E-EN profile.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 56 Td (The line PC for each line is connected to the factory OT network. Faults with the line PC, the) Tj ET
endstream
