BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (barcode scanners, or the connection to the Atlas shop-floor module are raised in Beacon under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (the category MFG-OT. Do not raise these as generic hardware tickets; the MFG-OT queue is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (staffed around the clock for the Penang factory and the generic queue is not.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 678 Td (4. Board families and process parameters) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (The Penang factory builds four board families on the SMT lines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 634 Td (- HX-MB is the Halcyon main board. It is shared by the HX-200, HX-210 and HX-220 gas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 621 Td (   detectors; the variant is set later by the sensor module fitted in final assembly, not on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td (   the SMT line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 595 Td (- TS4-GW is the Tessera TS-4 gateway board.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 582 Td (- TS4E-EN is the Tessera TS-4e edge node board. It has the finest pitch components in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 569 Td (   factory and is the most sensitive to paste and stencil condition.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (- LF60-SB is the Lumen sensor board. It is used on both the LF-60 and the LF-60P) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 543 Td (   optical-flow meters.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 531 Td (Board family | Stencil ID format | Stencil thickness | Reflow profile | Profile peak |) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 519 Td (Atmosphere | Under-stencil wipe | Solder paste) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 507 Td (HX-MB | STN-HX-MB-rev | 0.12 mm | RP-HX-07 | 245 \260C | Air | Every 10 prints | SAC305 Type 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 495 Td (TS4-GW | STN-TS4-GW-rev | 0.12 mm | RP-GW-04 | 243 \260C | Air | Every 10 prints | SAC305 Type 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 483 Td (TS4E-EN | STN-TS4E-EN-rev | 0.10 mm | RP-TS4E-03 | 240 \260C | Nitrogen, O2 below 1000 ppm | Every) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 471 Td (5 prints | SAC305 Type 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 459 Td (LF60-SB | STN-LF60-SB-rev | 0.13 mm | RP-LF-02 | 238 \260C | Air | Every 10 prints | SAC305 Type 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437 Td (Stencil IDs follow the format STN-<board>-<rev>, for example STN-HX-MB-D or STN-TS4E-EN-B. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 424 Td (revision letter on the stencil must match the stencil revision printed on the job traveller. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 411 Td (stencil with a different revision letter must not be used, even if the board revision appears) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 398 Td (compatible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (All board families use the same solder paste, SAC305 Type 4. Paste handling rules are in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (section 6.4 and apply regardless of board family.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 338 Td (5. Roles) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 317 Td (Role | Responsibility during changeover) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 305 Td (Line operator | Performs the changeover steps, scans feeders, loads the stencil, completes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 293 Td (operator sections of MFG-F-112.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 281 Td (Line lead \(setup technician\) | Owns the changeover end to end, checks programs and profiles,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 269 Td (performs the second check in step 19, calls the shift lead if the escalation threshold is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 257 Td (reached.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 245 Td (Material handler | Kits components and feeders for the next job, delivers thawed paste, returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 233 Td (unused reels to stores.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 221 Td (QA inspector | Performs and signs the first article inspection \(FAI\), decides whether the line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 209 Td (can be released.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 197 Td (Shift lead | Receives escalations when a changeover exceeds 40 minutes, decides on) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 185 Td (re-sequencing the schedule.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 173 Td (Process engineer \(on call\) | Supports AOI library tuning, profile issues and SPI failures that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 161 Td (the line lead cannot resolve.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 139 Td (Only the QA inspector can sign the FAI. The line lead cannot sign the FAI for a line they have) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 126 Td (set up, even if they hold a QA inspection qualification.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 101 Td (6. Preparation \(external activities\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 79 Td (Everything in this section is external work under SMED. It must be completed while the line is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 66 Td (still running the previous job. The changeover clock on MFG-F-112 does not start until the last) Tj ET
endstream
